  "description": "<div style=\"background:#6F41D7;color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\">✨ The perfect gift! Give the freedom to choose their own plan ✨</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:1.1rem;\">🎫 <strong>What is included?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#555555;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">A gift card valid for <strong style=\"color:#222222;\">1 year</strong> for all Fever experiences in London.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:1.1rem;\">📋 <strong>How does it work?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#555555;margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff0f2;color:#eb0028;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">1</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:600;\">Receive your code:</span> After purchase, you will receive a unique code by email with a PDF that you can forward to the recipient of the gift, or print out if you prefer to give a physical copy. Ready to give!</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#555555;margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff0f2;color:#eb0028;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">2</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:600;\">Redeem it on Fever:</span> The recipient redeems the code in the Fever app to generate their balance and have it available in the app. </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#555555;\">\r\n<div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff0f2;color:#eb0028;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">3</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:600;\">Start enjoying unforgettable experiences! </span>When using this gift card, its value is deducted from the total price of the tickets purchased. The code can be used on all Fever platforms, as often as you like over 1 year from the date of purchase, until the balance is used up.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n📱 <em>You can find all the important information in your confirmation email.</em></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:1.1rem;\">🎉 <strong>Redeemable for experiences such as</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Buy a Fever gift card and use it for...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr));gap:10px;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:92px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;\">🎻</span>Candlelight classical concerts</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:92px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;\">🎭</span>Fun comedy shows</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:92px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;\">🎤</span>Live concerts and music festivals</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:92px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;\">🍽️</span>Dining at top restaurants</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 0 0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">🎉 <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong>And much more!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:1.1rem;\">💃 <strong>Why this gift card is the ideal choice</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#555555;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">A special occasion for a special person! A Fever gift card is the perfect gift for both yourself and a special person you want to give something to. Are you looking for a unique gift in London but lacking inspiration? Look no further: we have the perfect gift for you that will make everyone happy! Who wouldn't want to dine at the trendiest restaurant, see their favourite artist at a concert, or treat themselves to a luxurious champagne tasting? <strong>There's nothing to lo